      "hints": [
        "Find the position vectors of $F$ and $G$ by translating the lower square by $\\overrightarrow{OD}$.",
        "Use the midpoint of $AF$ to locate $M$, then subtract position vectors."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "$\\overrightarrow{OF}=(11,8,10)$ and $\\overrightarrow{OG}=(3,8,10)$, while $\\overrightarrow{OM}=\\frac12[(8,0,0)+(11,8,10)]=(9.5,4,5)$.",
        "$\\overrightarrow{AM}=\\overrightarrow{OM}-\\overrightarrow{OA}=(1.5,4,5)$ and $\\overrightarrow{GM}=\\overrightarrow{OM}-\\overrightarrow{OG}=(6.5,-4,-5)$."
