      },
      "hints": [
        "For angle $GMA$, reverse both $\\overrightarrow{GM}$ and $\\overrightarrow{AM}$ from (i).",
        "The dot product is negative, so the angle must be obtuse."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "$\\overrightarrow{GM}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AM}=6.5(1.5)+(-4)(4)+(-5)(5)=-31.25$.",
        "$|GM|=\\sqrt{6.5^2+4^2+5^2}$ and $|AM|=\\sqrt{1.5^2+4^2+5^2}$. Thus $\\angle GMA=\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{-31.25}{|GM||AM|}\\right)=121^\\circ$ to the nearest degree."
